  SUPER_ADMIN
  FRANCHISEE
  /// Simulated account: mirrors one company miner (simulation_settings).
  /// Its cost ledger lives in simulated_cost_payments, never cost_payments;
  /// revenue is computed from the real miner's pool data (src/lib/simulation).
  /// Never billed, never in customer lists.
  SIMULATED
  /// Staff account with the same privileges as ADMIN (src/lib/auth/staffRoles).
  ACCOUNTING
  /// Point of contact for a Guild: treated like a CLIENT (the guild's miners,
  /// subaccount and invoices sit on this account) but changes reward wallets
  /// and the split only through guild requests (src/lib/guilds).
  GUILDMASTER
